{"id":"c21e5e4663b12909","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-acceptable-numbering.md","title":"可接受编号","display":"df-acceptable-numbering — 可接受编号","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-acceptable-numbering","aliases":["20-df-acceptable-numbering"],"display":"df-acceptable-numbering — 可接受编号","chapter":"1","section":"1.7","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 1.7.5","source_pdf_pages":[57],"source_printed_pages":[21],"depends_on":["[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-acceptable-numbering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-acceptable-numbering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-acceptable-numbering — 可接受编号"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 1.7.5"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>21</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi:\\omega\\twoheadrightarrow\\mathcal C_1\">\\(\\psi:\\omega\\twoheadrightarrow\\mathcal C_1\\)</span> 为部分可计算函数的一个编号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_e=\\psi(e)\">\\(\\psi_e=\\psi(e)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}acceptable\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\psi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists f,g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall e\\\n[\\psi_e=\\varphi_{f(e)}\\land\\varphi_e=\\psi_{g(e)}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}acceptable\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\psi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists f,g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall e\\\n[\\psi_e=\\varphi_{f(e)}\\land\\varphi_e=\\psi_{g(e)}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>双向翻译必须全可计算，只有“所有部分可计算函数都出现”不足以获得 s-m-n 或递归定理。标准编号可选择恒等翻译。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 1.7.5；印刷页 21；PDF 第 57 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\psi:\\omega\\twoheadrightarrow\\mathcal C_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi_e=\\psi(e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}acceptable\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\psi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists f,g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall e\\\n[\\psi_e=\\varphi_{f(e)}\\land\\varphi_e=\\psi_{g(e)}].","display":true}],"bytes":1380,"backlinks":[{"id":"69cf8a2e13927557","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-acceptable-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]。"},{"id":"7959e36d1026e950","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-acceptable-numbering]]；see [[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-thm-injective-numbering-translation]]；see [[20-thm-generalized-myhill]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-acceptable-numbering]] — 章 1；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-acceptable-numbering]]"}],"outgoing":["dc642dd12c05d028","e343870c773cb68e"]}